#! ia 1.0

@mandate public-agent-system-stewardship
  meaning
    says "The bounded authority of the agent-system steward over the agent-system folder of the public language workspace."
    answers "Which moves may the agent-system steward make over the agent-system folder?"
  governance
    requires "Claim no host permission or execution from this mandate."
  authority
    participant @agent public-agent-system-steward
    moves [Observation, Verification, Synthesis]
    scope [@workspace language-workspace]
    covers [".ia/src/systems/agent-system/"]

